OL,5,G0100 Taggart
OL,6,     FThe team investigate when boxing
OL,7,     Fpromoter Bobby Walker is found
OL,8,     Fstrangled after a fight, and
OL,9,     Fdiscover that the winning fighter
OL,10,     Fwas having an affair with the
OL,11,     Fvictim's widow.
OL,12,G0205 Taggart
OL,13,     FA bomb goes off at an important
OL,14,     Fconference, killing the keynote
OL,15,     Fspeaker. The finger points at the
OL,16,     Fprotestors picketing the event,
OL,17,     Fbut what about the victim's
OL,18,     Fcolleagues?
